# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository *and* in the working
# tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites every source
# file with CRLF, which adds one byte per line. The runtime that `pydrud init`
# vendors into each project is ~17 000 lines, so the same bundle measured
# ~584 KB on Linux/macOS and ~600 KB on Windows — enough to trip the APK size
# budget in tests/test_scaffold_project.py and to ship a fatter APK.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts must keep CRLF or cmd.exe cannot run them.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Never touch binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
